{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27016","headline":"拾得古砚 · 姚合","name":"拾得古砚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"僻性爱古物，终岁求不获。\n昨朝得古砚，黄河滩之侧。\n念此黄河中，应有昔人宅。\n宅亦作流水，斯砚未变易。\n波澜所激触，背面生罅隙。\n质状朴且丑，今人作不得。\n捧持且惊叹，不敢施笔墨。\n或恐先圣人，尝用修六籍。\n置之洁净室，一日三磨拭。\n大喜豪贵嫌，久长得保惜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27016.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27016","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}